This is a sloppified version made to compile on my end. It will contain a lot of slop.

Uses also code from:
    GME (Game Music Emulator): https://github.com/libgme/game-music-emu
    Hively Tracker: https://github.com/pete-gordon/hivelytracker
    ModPlug: https://github.com/Konstanty/libmodplug
    SC68: https://sourceforge.net/projects/sc68/
    SexyPSF: https://github.com/CoreDumpling/sexypsf
    Sidplay: https://sourceforge.net/projects/sidplay2/
